<title>UK: BIL sets 100 mln mark Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>BIL sets 100 mln mark Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Banque Internationale a Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE INTERNATIONALE A LUXEMBOURG SA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    12.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE  L-12.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.45     SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 119  NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
